WHATNOW

What tamlinux is doing now and what comes next. Read this first; revise
it at the end of every session (work/README-work).

Updated: 2026-11-21, with W6


STATE

  Version 0.0.3 on branch dev (uncommitted working tree, ready for Fred's
  trial). Full-screen program support is implemented and verified against
  the automated checks:
  - Scroll regions (DECSTBM), origin mode (DECOM), insert mode (IRM).
  - Alternate screen (47, 1047, 1049) with a second grid and its own
    saved cursor; tl_term_resize handles both grids.
  - DEC special graphics (ESC ( 0 / ESC ( B), combining characters stored
    with their base cell, and cursor styles (DECSCUSR: block, underline,
    bar).
  - Per-buffer row damage tracking with coalesced wl_surface_damage_buffer
    rectangles.

  make clean && make, make test (with libtam include path), ASan/UBSan
  sanitize tests, headless tam-pane check, and readelf -d (libc and libm
  only) all pass.


